{"sequence":13,"timestamp":"2026-03-27T23:15:16.094592698Z","event_type":"amendment_queued","details":{"amendment_id":"fr-1-47383507","body":"In `crates/tank_api/src/handlers/save.rs:23-24`, `post_load` accepts `Json<Value>`, serializes it to a String with `serde_json::to_string`, then `SaveFile::from_json` immediately parses that String back into a `Value`. This is a redundant round-trip (Value → String → Value). Add a `SaveFile::from_value(value: Value)` method that contains the migration/deserialization logic, and have `from_json` call it after the initial parse. Then `post_load` can call `from_value` directly, avoiding the unnecessary serialization step.","dedup_key":"c768151946d904aa99ab64018fabd213d71462d6b5ca87d502be9408d0d8aef7","run_id":"run-20260327225238","source":"workflow_stage","source_stage":"final_review"}}
{"sequence":14,"timestamp":"2026-03-27T23:15:16.099411786Z","event_type":"amendment_queued","details":{"amendment_id":"fr-1-9fa711df","body":"The `SimError::SchemaVersionMismatch { expected, actual }` variant in `crates/tank_core/src/types/actions.rs:72-73` is now dead code — no code path constructs it after the migration to `SchemaVersionTooNew` / `SchemaVersionTooOld`. It should be removed to prevent future contributors from accidentally using the wrong error variant.","dedup_key":"62ada76c905cc2bd2821704d6ecdf6cabb3549ac5f97b92daf4f9c6287e0dbeb","run_id":"run-20260327225238","source":"workflow_stage","source_stage":"final_review"}}
{"sequence":15,"timestamp":"2026-03-27T23:15:16.103648428Z","event_type":"amendment_queued","details":{"amendment_id":"fr-1-fe78d820","body":"`crates/tank_core/src/save.rs:117-121` truncates `schema_version` with `as u32` after reading it as `u64`. A save declaring a version larger than `u32::MAX` will wrap (for example `4294967296` becomes `0`) and `SaveFile::from_json` will report `SchemaVersionTooOld` instead of the required future-version error. Parse with `u32::try_from(...)` and reject out-of-range values explicitly so unknown future saves cannot be misclassified.","dedup_key":"79e87c268c7efb4a190438727081a1d30c0ea6cbe958e9e6bc5793b448cdc049","run_id":"run-20260327225238","source":"workflow_stage","source_stage":"final_review"}}
